***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================

***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
***REMOVED*** Docker Compose environment selection
***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
***REMOVED*** Local dev (default):
COMPOSE_FILE=compose.yml:compose.dev.yml
COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME=dev

***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
***REMOVED*** REQUIRED FOR BOT PROFILE (make docker-bot-up)
***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=

***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
***REMOVED*** BOT CORE
***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
***REMOVED*** Logical environment name (development, staging, production). Used for log
***REMOVED*** tagging and Langfuse trace environment isolation.
ENV=development
***REMOVED*** Enable verbose logging and debug-only behaviour. Never set this on prod.
DEBUG=false
***REMOVED*** Logging configuration.
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
LOG_FORMAT=text                  ***REMOVED*** text | json (json for prod log shipping)
***REMOVED*** LOG_FILE=                       ***REMOVED*** Optional: path to log file. Empty -> stderr only.
***REMOVED*** ADMIN_IDS=12345,67890           ***REMOVED*** Comma-separated Telegram user IDs with admin commands.
***REMOVED*** BOT_DOMAIN=                     ***REMOVED*** Public webhook domain (only required for webhook mode).
***REMOVED*** BOT_LANGUAGE=ru                 ***REMOVED*** Default UI language for the bot (ru, en, uk).
***REMOVED*** Telegram start-command retry tuning (used by PropertyBot.start polling lock).
***REMOVED*** BOT_START_MAX_ATTEMPTS=10
***REMOVED*** BOT_START_RETRY_DELAY_SEC=2
***REMOVED*** BOT_START_RETRY_MAX_SEC=60
***REMOVED*** Mini App / WebApp launch URL surfaced in inline keyboards.
***REMOVED*** MINI_APP_URL=https://example.com/miniapp

***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
***REMOVED*** LOCAL EMBEDDINGS (BGE-M3, default for dev and VPS)
***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
BGE_M3_TIMEOUT=120
COLBERT_TIMEOUT=120
RERANK_CANDIDATES_MAX=10
***REMOVED*** Skip reranking when RRF fusion score >= threshold
***REMOVED*** Must be > 1/61 (≈0.01639, single-query top-1 RRF) to avoid always skipping
SKIP_RERANK_THRESHOLD=0.018
OMP_NUM_THREADS=4

***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
***REMOVED*** DATABASE CREDENTIALS (compose services)
***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=<change-me>  ***REMOVED*** Change in production!
REDIS_PASSWORD=<change-me>  ***REMOVED*** Change in production!
***REMOVED*** If you change REDIS_PASSWORD locally, run: make local-redis-recreate
***REMOVED*** Optional native-run override. When unset, the bot derives:
***REMOVED*** REDIS_URL=redis://:${REDIS_PASSWORD}@localhost:6379
REDIS_MAXMEMORY=512mb  ***REMOVED*** dev: 512mb, VPS: 256mb (default in compose.yml)
***REMOVED*** REDIS_HOST=localhost            ***REMOVED*** Redis host for native-run; compose uses service alias.
***REMOVED*** REDIS_PORT=6379                 ***REMOVED*** Redis port for native-run.

***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
***REMOVED*** REQUIRED FOR ML PROFILE (make docker-ml-up, langfuse)
***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=   ***REMOVED*** generate: openssl rand -base64 32
SALT=              ***REMOVED*** generate: openssl rand -base64 32
ENCRYPTION_KEY=    ***REMOVED*** generate: openssl rand -hex 32

***REMOVED*** ==============================================================================
