QDRANT_COLLECTION=gdrive_documents_bge
QDRANT_HISTORY_COLLECTION=conversation_history
***REMOVED*** HISTORY_RELEVANCE_THRESHOLD=0.7  ***REMOVED*** Min similarity score for history results (0.0-1.0, default 0.7; ***REMOVED***433)

